From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 207] panvk/csf: debug shader writes_memory flag and dispatch stats
Generated-by: LLM

Add a serialized per-variant writes_memory flag (buffer or image stores
and atomics, not shared/scratch/output) next to reads_images, and with
PANVK_PASS_STATS=1 count dispatches by whether their shader reads images
and writes memory, to see whether compute waits on fragment work could
be deferred like the vertex/tiler ones.  Debug only; a biblioklept
tallying which readers only browse and which also scribble.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/206

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_cmd_buffer.h b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_cmd_buffer.h
